gin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ladFuIF.png\" alt=\"Совместимость\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>YUNG's Better Witch Huts предназначен для полной совместимости с любыми модами на генерацию мира, включая:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-strongholds-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Strongholds</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Mineshafts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-dungeons-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Dungeons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-desert-temples-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Desert Temples</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Extras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-bridges-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Bridges</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"Используйте код YUNGNICKYOUNG на Bisect Hosting для получения скидки 25%!\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
